UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetDefaultScalingFactor
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when default scaling factor is higher than max scaling factor cap
    │   └── it should revert with "ISF"
    └── when default scaling factor is less than max scaling factor cap
        ├── it should set default scaling factor
        └── it should emit a {DefaultScalingFactorSet} event
